	(text "fsw = 23(R^-0.856)\nR =~(23/fsw)^1.1682\nR =~ 160k\n\nfsw is ~300kHz to balance toff safety, efficiency and component sizing\nchoosing R = 150k, from datasheet Table 1 "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 125.476 0)
